Description: SubwaySurfers-Linux 1.0 — World Tour: San Francisco
 SubwaySurfers-Linux v1.0 packaging for Subway Surfers World Tour: San Francisco
 (underlying game build v1.94.0, Unity 2019.4.18f1) with WASD movement controls,
 unified shared save storage (~/.local/share/SubwaySurfers-Linux/Save/),
 invisible event-driven autosave, atomic file writes, crash recovery,
 exclusive save locking, and fullscreen startup (F11 toggle).
 .
